+
+## Browser-defect fixes applied
+
+Three product defects fixed to pass the external Cypress acceptance suite:
+
+1. **DOM identity preservation** (`js/app.js`): Replaced `innerHTML = ''` destroy-and-recreate render with reconciliation-based `reconcileTodoList()`. Existing `<li>` elements are updated in place (class, checkbox, label) instead of being removed and recreated. Prevents Cypress "element detached from DOM" errors on toggle interactions.
+
+2. **Editing-mode CSS** (`index.html`): Added inline `<style>` rules to hide `.view` and show `.edit` when `<li>` has `.editing` class. The `todomvc-app-css` package is not installed; these rules fill the gap so the toggle checkbox is properly hidden during editing.
+
+3. **Escape/blur race** (`js/app.js`): Added `escapePressed` flag. `cancelEdit()` sets it; the blur handler checks it and returns early. Prevents the blur handler from re-saving the edit after Escape cancels it. `startEdit()` resets the flag.
